WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.060 --> 01:38.940
[Episode 12]

01:46.480 --> 01:47.570
Wangyu was speaking the truth.

01:47.960 --> 01:49.250
She's not as ordinary as I thought.

02:07.550 --> 02:08.220
Show yourself.

02:09.070 --> 02:10.050
That sickening beast is dead.

02:34.070 --> 02:35.770
I'll tame you and make you our sect gatekeeper.

02:50.710 --> 02:52.210
Since I've captured its primordial spirit,

02:52.760 --> 02:54.100
you may have its body.

02:55.710 --> 02:58.020
This Level 2 Demon Beast is literally a treasure trove.

02:58.350 --> 02:59.820
Its hide is already impenetrable.

03:00.430 --> 03:01.380
I just don't know

03:01.640 --> 03:03.180
if you can break through its carapace.

03:06.710 --> 03:08.410
You're just a young cultivator at the Qi Refining Stage.

03:08.430 --> 03:09.660
But you have quite a lot of artifacts, huh?

03:10.150 --> 03:11.330
Will you kill me and steal them from me?

03:12.790 --> 03:14.100
To you, they might be treasures.

03:14.640 --> 03:15.690
But to me,

03:15.840 --> 03:17.020
those are just junk.

03:28.070 --> 03:29.130
You're too reckless.

03:29.510 --> 03:30.900
The horns and claws of Blackflood Drake

03:30.920 --> 03:32.740
are excellent materials that can be used to make top-quality artifacts.

03:33.920 --> 03:35.290
You'll let them go to waste if you hack it as such.

03:36.400 --> 03:37.020
Stand back.

03:37.040 --> 03:37.770
Step aside.

03:45.750 --> 03:46.660
When harvesting a Demon Beast,

03:46.910 --> 03:48.060
you have to extract its inner core first.

03:50.560 --> 03:51.980
It's been too long since I've done this.

03:52.630 --> 03:53.850
I'm not as sharp as I used to be.

03:54.590 --> 03:56.060
But I can't afford to embarrass myself here.

04:13.560 --> 04:14.260
What is that?

04:21.750 --> 04:23.780
The core of a drake should be hard and tough.

04:24.960 --> 04:25.820
But this is...

05:12.240 --> 05:13.500
Consider yourself lucky.

07:07.600 --> 07:09.220
The portal to Trial Ground will be closed soon.

07:09.510 --> 07:10.220
Disciples,

07:10.430 --> 07:11.580
evacuate immediately.

07:12.950 --> 07:13.850
It's finally ending.

07:15.750 --> 07:17.370
The portal to Trial Ground will be closed soon.

07:17.720 --> 07:18.410
Disciples,

07:18.680 --> 07:19.900
evacuate immediately.

07:24.390 --> 07:26.220
The portal to Trial Ground will be closed soon.

07:26.510 --> 07:27.220
Disciples,

07:27.430 --> 07:28.540
evacuate immediately.

07:32.560 --> 07:33.700
What's happening to me?

07:36.270 --> 07:37.370
They're closing the portal to Trial Ground.

07:41.190 --> 07:42.370
Why have I slept for this long?

07:42.720 --> 07:44.540
The portal to Trial Ground will be closed soon.

07:44.800 --> 07:45.490
Disciples,

07:45.630 --> 07:46.900
evacuate immediately.

07:47.240 --> 07:47.730
This won't do.

07:47.950 --> 07:48.980
I have to leave immediately.

09:12.190 --> 09:12.900
Wake up.

09:41.390 --> 09:42.730
How long are you going to stay asleep?

09:43.000 --> 09:43.930
It'll be too late if we don't leave now.

09:51.040 --> 09:51.850
I...

09:52.390 --> 09:53.290
Have I

09:53.830 --> 09:54.900
slept for a long time?

09:55.430 --> 09:56.050
That's not the point here.

09:57.160 --> 09:57.930
The point is

09:58.440 --> 09:59.250
that they're closing the portal.

10:00.310 --> 10:02.140
The portal to Trial Ground will be closed soon.

10:02.390 --> 10:03.100
Disciples,

10:03.270 --> 10:04.460
- evacuate immediately. - Is this already the fifth day?

10:05.160 --> 10:05.980
Are they closing the portal now?

10:21.910 --> 10:22.890
What should I do with this boy?

10:23.510 --> 10:24.770
Should I silence him right now

10:25.480 --> 10:26.850
so that he won't spout nonsense outside?

10:28.750 --> 10:29.460
Aren't you going to leave?

10:51.910 --> 10:53.250
That was the Blackflood Drake's lust sack.

10:53.600 --> 10:55.420
I didn't expect it to be a male drake, which was quite rare.

10:56.240 --> 10:57.850
Contact by any female

10:58.550 --> 10:59.820
will cause it to release

11:01.080 --> 11:02.300
an aphrodisiac poison mist.

11:15.240 --> 11:17.130
You should know well the kind of person I am.

11:17.440 --> 11:18.820
What happened between us

11:19.200 --> 11:20.420
was merely a misunderstanding.

11:21.440 --> 11:22.850
Just treat it as a dream.

11:23.870 --> 11:24.580
I understand.

11:28.270 --> 11:29.650
If you dare to tell anyone what happened today...

11:29.720 --> 11:30.770
Nobody else will know.

11:37.040 --> 11:38.370
I'll take the chest with me.

11:38.550 --> 11:39.370
I suppose you have no objections.

11:39.960 --> 11:40.850
Not at all.

11:44.360 --> 11:45.460
What about the spirit herbs?

11:51.240 --> 11:52.460
I'll take the Blood Spirit Flower.

11:55.150 --> 11:56.370
You can have the rest of it.

12:06.330 --> 12:07.250
The Celestial Essence Fruit

12:07.840 --> 12:08.700
is finally mine.

12:51.320 --> 12:52.220
You'd better stop now.

12:52.360 --> 12:53.300
We're running out of time.

13:01.870 --> 13:02.890
This path is blocked off.

13:03.960 --> 13:04.770
Do you have any solutions?

13:07.270 --> 13:08.250
I do.

13:09.720 --> 13:11.180
But thanks to you,

13:11.200 --> 13:12.340
my power is entirely depleted.

13:12.790 --> 13:13.530
Therefore,

13:14.440 --> 13:15.580
you have to open a path.

13:16.790 --> 13:17.770
Your power is entirely depleted?

13:18.630 --> 13:19.370
How is that possible?

13:19.960 --> 13:20.770
How dare you ask me that?

13:29.270 --> 13:30.340
It doesn't look that way to me.

13:42.150 --> 13:42.700
Hurry!

13:42.840 --> 13:43.300
If we don't make it out,

13:43.480 --> 13:44.700
we'll be trapped here for 60 years!

13:46.440 --> 13:47.100
- Hurry! - Run for your life!

13:47.440 --> 13:49.220
The portal to Trial Ground will be closed soon.

13:49.510 --> 13:50.220
Disciples,

13:50.440 --> 13:51.610
evacuate immediately.

14:18.030 --> 14:18.610
Grandmaster!

14:19.080 --> 14:20.580
Slow down! Don't panic!

14:28.510 --> 14:29.300
Grandmaster!

14:38.840 --> 14:39.420
Hurry!

14:39.600 --> 14:40.130
Hurry!

14:40.480 --> 14:41.530
Where are the rest of you?

14:41.960 --> 14:42.420
Hurry!

15:03.390 --> 15:04.460
My Golden Brick Talisman

15:04.670 --> 15:05.820
actually broke just after two uses.

15:06.510 --> 15:08.340
Which is more important? The talisman or your life?

15:08.670 --> 15:09.650
Both are equally as important.

15:11.000 --> 15:11.820
What a moneygrubber.

15:32.550 --> 15:33.300
I'm Han Li.

15:34.320 --> 15:35.060
What's your name?

15:36.270 --> 15:37.820
You'll be trapped here for the next 60 years

15:38.270 --> 15:40.300
if you don't make it out by nightfall.

15:44.720 --> 15:45.980
May I know your name?

15:46.750 --> 15:47.650
I'm Han Li.

15:47.790 --> 15:48.530
"Li", as in erecting a tombstone.

15:53.480 --> 15:54.530
I was just asking.

15:54.790 --> 15:55.940
It's fine if you don't want to answer me.

15:57.360 --> 15:58.610
I'm Nangong Wan.

15:59.790 --> 16:00.530
I'm Han Li.

16:00.840 --> 16:02.100
I don't care what your name is.

16:02.270 --> 16:04.340
We'll be complete strangers once we leave this place.

16:04.910 --> 16:05.700
Nangong Wan,

16:06.000 --> 16:06.980
if, one day,

16:07.150 --> 16:07.980
you're in any danger,

16:08.150 --> 16:09.130
I'll surely come to your aid.

16:09.720 --> 16:11.060
You should tend to yourself first.

16:11.320 --> 16:12.220
Do not find me again.

16:22.120 --> 16:23.490
Time is almost up!

16:24.080 --> 16:25.460
The portal will be closed soon!

16:26.790 --> 16:29.010
I don't think anyone else is coming out.

16:29.510 --> 16:30.490
It's not nightfall yet.

16:31.120 --> 16:31.850
Let's wait a little longer.

16:32.200 --> 16:33.370
I'm sure anyone who's still alive

16:33.550 --> 16:34.980
has exited the portal long ago.

16:35.440 --> 16:36.180
Fellow peers,

16:36.600 --> 16:38.100
I and the Moonshadow Sect shall make a move first.

16:45.240 --> 16:46.100
Han Li?

17:10.480 --> 17:11.490
That was a tough trip.

17:20.480 --> 17:21.530
Is this how you lead your team?

17:22.000 --> 17:23.460
Are these all of the members you have left?

17:24.150 --> 17:24.850
Let's go!

17:32.720 --> 17:33.490
Seems like

17:33.960 --> 17:35.610
this trial was perilous indeed.

17:36.150 --> 17:37.610
So many disciples have ended up as casualties.

17:40.080 --> 17:40.820
Nangong Wan.

17:41.670 --> 17:42.770
Has she already left?

17:56.480 --> 17:57.700
Did you get anything out of it?

18:14.630 --> 18:15.580
I shouldn't show them too much.

18:16.360 --> 18:17.460
If not, they'll suspect me.

18:19.960 --> 18:20.850
Is that the Celestial Essence Fruit?

19:00.350 --> 19:01.180
Old gambling addict,

19:03.400 --> 19:04.490
I accept my loss.

19:16.830 --> 19:17.660
Take these!

19:22.920 --> 19:23.570
Let's return now.

19:25.880 --> 19:26.490
Let's go.

19:27.480 --> 19:28.900
How did you manage

19:29.680 --> 19:30.570
to obtain these spirit herbs?

19:35.310 --> 19:36.140
Grandmaster,

19:36.790 --> 19:37.900
I followed your advice

19:38.440 --> 19:39.940
upon entering the portal.

19:40.640 --> 19:41.460
I avoided conflicts

19:41.880 --> 19:43.010
and focused on finding spirit herbs.

19:44.270 --> 19:45.090
In the end,

19:45.590 --> 19:47.220
by a stroke of luck,

19:50.640 --> 19:52.340
I encountered several peers

19:52.440 --> 19:53.860
from other sects who fought fierce battles.

19:54.640 --> 19:55.380
I picked up

19:55.550 --> 19:56.770
the spirit herbs they left behind.

20:01.750 --> 20:04.250
So, you picked them up on the way, huh?

20:10.720 --> 20:11.940
You're quite lucky.

20:13.400 --> 20:14.010
Come here.

20:18.830 --> 20:19.730
From today onward,

20:20.310 --> 20:21.660
you shall serve me

20:22.160 --> 20:23.220
as one of my disciples.

20:25.550 --> 20:26.290
Thank you, Grandmaster.

20:26.960 --> 20:28.380
Why are you still calling me that?

20:29.030 --> 20:29.860
You should address me as Master.

20:30.030 --> 20:30.620
Yes, Master.

20:32.790 --> 20:33.530
Greetings, Master.

20:34.160 --> 20:35.050
I'm Han Li.

20:37.440 --> 20:38.490
Your name is Han Li, huh?

21:06.640 --> 21:07.460
Get up here.

21:09.030 --> 21:09.660
Han Li,

21:10.310 --> 21:11.330
come to my side.

21:32.590 --> 21:33.420
So many people had died

21:33.920 --> 21:35.140
during this trial.

21:35.720 --> 21:36.420
On the path of cultivation,

21:36.790 --> 21:37.980
one wrong move

21:38.640 --> 21:39.290
leads to utter ruin.

21:42.200 --> 21:43.730
He didn't get ahead of himself.

21:44.270 --> 21:45.860
And, he's grieving over the loss of his peers.

21:46.640 --> 21:48.980
He seems like a good-natured boy.

21:51.720 --> 21:53.460
This is the path of cultivation.

21:54.880 --> 21:56.490
There are many different sights along the way.

21:57.960 --> 21:59.050
Since you managed to survive,

21:59.440 --> 22:00.490
you should be more open-minded.

22:00.790 --> 22:02.010
That is what it means

22:02.240 --> 22:03.180
to achieve true peace.

22:07.640 --> 22:09.010
You can have this

22:09.200 --> 22:09.940
Qingyuan Sword Manual

22:10.000 --> 22:11.220
as our meeting gift.

22:13.000 --> 22:15.140
But you can only practice it during the Qi Refining Stage.

22:15.640 --> 22:16.530
Do not practice it excessively.

22:17.550 --> 22:19.220
I'll select another art for you

22:19.750 --> 22:21.490
once you reach the Foundation Establishment Stage in the future.

22:23.510 --> 22:24.140
Thank you, Master.

22:31.400 --> 22:31.860
Master.

22:32.720 --> 22:33.330
I have something

22:34.030 --> 22:34.900
to report to you.

22:36.440 --> 22:37.050
You may speak.

22:39.310 --> 22:40.770
When I was at Bloody Trial Ground,

22:41.790 --> 22:43.460
I encountered several sect members of Spirit Beast Mountain.

22:44.920 --> 22:46.140
They were behaving sneakily.

22:46.790 --> 22:47.490
It didn't feel like

22:47.640 --> 22:48.660
they were official sect members.

22:51.440 --> 22:52.380
Tell me the details.

22:53.030 --> 22:54.220
Most of the techniques they used

22:54.790 --> 22:55.290
were related

22:55.310 --> 22:56.530
to the arts of toxic and demonic cultivation.

22:57.110 --> 22:58.010
They were ruthless.

22:58.550 --> 22:59.250
They didn't try to steal spirit herbs.

22:59.400 --> 23:00.140
They merely killed.

23:00.550 --> 23:01.900
They didn't even spare their fellow sect members.

23:08.510 --> 23:10.380
Could they be the troublemakers?

23:13.160 --> 23:13.860
Han Li.

23:14.480 --> 23:16.250
You reported your findings to me.

23:16.830 --> 23:17.860
That deserves praise.

23:18.750 --> 23:20.050
However, this is a huge deal.

23:20.680 --> 23:22.180
Do not let anyone know about this.

23:23.240 --> 23:24.250
Yes, Master.

23:26.720 --> 23:28.140
Could the major casualties

23:29.200 --> 23:31.420
be related to this incident?

24:49.680 --> 24:51.940
You've been behaving strangely upon returning from Bloody Trial Ground.

24:53.350 --> 24:54.730
It's either you're in a daze

24:55.030 --> 24:56.570
or you vent your frustrations on the chest.

24:57.440 --> 24:58.490
That's not true.

25:00.920 --> 25:01.860
You're still denying it?

25:04.680 --> 25:06.460
I spent so much effort just to procure this chest.

25:06.680 --> 25:07.460
But now, I can't unlock it.

25:07.790 --> 25:08.810
How could I not be frustrated?

25:10.400 --> 25:12.050
I told you not to suppress your powers before heading inside.

25:12.480 --> 25:13.250
You didn't heed my advice.

25:14.480 --> 25:16.140
Now, things have taken an unexpected turn.

25:21.270 --> 25:22.140
Has the Blood Spirit Flower

25:22.680 --> 25:23.730
been delivered to Yan Clan Stronghold?

25:25.440 --> 25:26.220
Did you forget?

25:26.720 --> 25:28.570
The first thing you did upon exiting Trial Ground

25:29.160 --> 25:30.900
was to instruct Qing to head to Yan Clan Stronghold.

25:32.310 --> 25:33.290
Judging by the time,

25:34.000 --> 25:35.180
she should arrive soon.

25:42.030 --> 25:42.660
Wan.

25:43.680 --> 25:44.700
Be honest with me.

25:45.750 --> 25:47.700
What exactly happened at Trial Ground?

25:48.640 --> 25:50.420
It feels like you've changed.

25:51.440 --> 25:53.220
Why have you lost all of your powers?

25:53.830 --> 25:55.010
Even the Maiden Cycle Technique

25:55.270 --> 25:56.250
doesn't have such an effect on its practitioner.

25:59.400 --> 26:01.010
It's the fault of the Blackflood Drake.

26:01.640 --> 26:03.420
And, someone even cut off my escape route

26:03.720 --> 26:05.050
when I engaged it in combat.

26:06.000 --> 26:07.700
If not, I would've never ended up in such a pathetic state.

26:10.240 --> 26:11.900
If so, how did you manage to escape by yourself?

26:12.240 --> 26:12.940
Nichang.

26:14.640 --> 26:15.490
I suspect

26:15.790 --> 26:17.140
that some evil forces managed to sneak in

26:17.440 --> 26:19.010
during the trip to Trial Ground.

26:19.750 --> 26:20.900
If not, there wouldn't be

26:21.480 --> 26:22.860
that many casualties.

26:23.350 --> 26:24.290
Are you referring

26:25.030 --> 26:25.770
to the demonic sects?

26:28.790 --> 26:29.460
And,

26:29.880 --> 26:31.490
they entered the Trial Ground

26:31.510 --> 26:32.460
right under our noses.

26:32.750 --> 26:34.420
I'm afraid they've infiltrated the Seven Sects long ago.

26:35.070 --> 26:35.810
Maybe

26:36.200 --> 26:36.940
Moonshadow Sect

26:37.160 --> 26:38.380
was jeopardized as well.

26:46.310 --> 26:47.730
Members of the demonic sects aren't that rare.

26:49.440 --> 26:51.180
Just let them be.

26:51.880 --> 26:53.940
Nothing major will go wrong for now

26:54.680 --> 26:55.940
as long as we're holding the fort in our sect.

26:56.750 --> 26:57.730
But those disciples...

27:00.960 --> 27:02.460
Look at the state you're in.

27:03.830 --> 27:05.290
Even if the demonic sects were to invade us now,

27:05.640 --> 27:07.140
do you think you can deal with them?

27:08.830 --> 27:10.050
Right now, your priority

27:10.480 --> 27:11.980
is to restore your powers as soon as possible.

27:14.880 --> 27:16.570
Although it's a shame that many of our sect members

27:16.640 --> 27:17.490
failed to make it out alive,

27:18.240 --> 27:19.290
the world is unpredictable after all.

27:19.830 --> 27:21.660
We can only pin our hopes on those who survived.

27:22.240 --> 27:23.940
May they progress more smoothly

27:25.070 --> 27:26.530
on the path of cultivation.

27:33.110 --> 27:33.700
I am Zhong Wu.

27:33.790 --> 27:34.290
I am Zhong Shu.

27:34.440 --> 27:35.730
We're here to congratulate you, Young Master.

27:36.350 --> 27:36.900
Speak.

27:37.480 --> 27:38.330
Young Master,

27:38.590 --> 27:39.940
I think I've somewhat accomplished the task

27:40.200 --> 27:42.180
that you've assigned to me.

27:42.830 --> 27:43.730
The cultivators of the Seven Sects...

27:43.920 --> 27:44.380
No, I mean,

27:44.720 --> 27:46.090
the fools of the Seven Sects.

27:46.310 --> 27:47.290
Around 70% of them were killed.

27:47.440 --> 27:49.180
They were Qi Refining Stage experts.

27:49.440 --> 27:50.900
Their foundation has definitely been damaged.

27:51.350 --> 27:53.180
So, for the remaining 30%,

27:53.590 --> 27:55.220
do you expect me to deal with them for you?

27:55.400 --> 27:56.290
Young Master, please be appeased.

27:57.240 --> 27:58.570
The final battle is nearing. Forget about 30%.

27:58.720 --> 28:00.420
I'll deal with them for you even if there are 3,000% of them left...

28:00.440 --> 28:01.140
Shut up.

28:01.200 --> 28:01.570
I...

28:02.790 --> 28:03.530
Young Master, please be appeased.

28:04.590 --> 28:05.980
Have you accomplished the task I assigned you?

28:08.240 --> 28:08.940
He means the herb.

28:09.590 --> 28:10.250
I have.

28:13.790 --> 28:14.420
You passed.

28:15.680 --> 28:17.570
Seems like you're not entirely useless.

28:17.830 --> 28:19.180
At least you're somewhat useful.

28:20.640 --> 28:21.940
Young Master, thank you for the praise!

28:23.160 --> 28:24.460
Hurry and return to Spirit Beast Mountain.

28:24.680 --> 28:26.810
Go and instigate the fools of Seven Sects.

28:26.920 --> 28:28.290
Persuade them to join Ghost Spirit Sect.

28:28.750 --> 28:30.050
It's best if they're at the Foundation Establishment Stage.

28:30.310 --> 28:30.770
Roger that!

28:30.830 --> 28:31.860
Stop shouting!

28:32.110 --> 28:33.050
You have to be discreet.

28:33.880 --> 28:34.980
Just wait and see.

28:44.830 --> 28:45.570
What a talent.

28:46.200 --> 28:47.560
Young Master, you have excellent taste!

29:11.200 --> 29:13.290
The two sect members who returned from Bloody Trial Ground

29:13.640 --> 29:15.070
had been kneeling there for one night.

29:15.640 --> 29:17.000
You should see them.

29:18.920 --> 29:20.180
How dare they come back

29:20.550 --> 29:21.730
without the Blood Spirit Flower?

29:33.960 --> 29:34.810
Elder Liu.

29:35.510 --> 29:37.330
Is there still no news from the Seven Sects?

29:41.640 --> 29:43.810
The trip to Bloody Trial Ground ended a few days ago.

29:44.880 --> 29:45.900
Logically speaking,

29:46.790 --> 29:47.620
the Blood Spirit Flower

29:47.750 --> 29:48.700
should've arrived at its destination by now.

30:07.640 --> 30:09.180
Are you the contact of Yan Clan Stronghold?

30:09.440 --> 30:11.530
I'm here to see Lord of the Yan Clan Stronghold

30:11.720 --> 30:12.810
under the order of the Moonshadow Sect's sect leader.

30:25.960 --> 30:26.420
Young Master.

30:26.590 --> 30:27.620
This is the Blood Spirit Flower.

30:30.270 --> 30:31.490
Elders, I appreciate the effort.

30:33.680 --> 30:36.050
I suppose they managed to harvest it as well.

30:36.880 --> 30:39.140
Who's daring enough to cause trouble in our territory?

30:47.030 --> 30:48.090
The Blood Spirit Flower?

31:13.000 --> 31:14.770
Elder Liu, don't be scared.

31:16.400 --> 31:18.660
I just wish to be your friend.

31:26.590 --> 31:27.180
My Lord.

31:32.480 --> 31:33.250
My Lord,

31:33.440 --> 31:35.460
do you still remember the guy from Ghost Spirit Sect?

31:37.110 --> 31:38.330
He has found us again.

31:39.000 --> 31:40.050
This time, he said

31:40.350 --> 31:41.330
he's able to save Young Lady.

31:42.920 --> 31:44.490
Are you willing to see him?

31:56.750 --> 31:57.570
Please.

32:22.510 --> 32:24.460
You dare to come here alone even though

32:24.680 --> 32:25.980
you're merely at the Mid Foundation Establishment Stage.

32:26.590 --> 32:27.940
You're pretty bold, aren't you?

32:29.440 --> 32:30.490
To express my sincerity,

32:30.880 --> 32:31.860
I've prepared

32:32.000 --> 32:33.570
a humble gift.

32:33.960 --> 32:35.090
It's meant for Young Lady.

32:35.830 --> 32:37.050
Forget about the gift.

32:37.880 --> 32:39.330
Right now, what she requires the most

32:40.270 --> 32:41.380
is a herb.

32:43.510 --> 32:45.090
I have the Blood Spirit Flower as well.

32:45.400 --> 32:46.570
But it can't cure the root of the problem.

32:46.830 --> 32:48.900
And, one's foundation will be damaged upon consumption.

32:49.070 --> 32:50.050
I'm afraid

32:51.000 --> 32:53.530
she'll never be able to reach the Core Formation Stage for the rest of her life.

32:53.960 --> 32:54.810
Lord Yan,

32:55.310 --> 32:56.660
can you bear for that to happen?

32:57.240 --> 32:58.220
What do you mean?

32:58.730 --> 33:00.330
Don't tell me you have other solutions.

33:00.680 --> 33:02.220
Naturally.

33:02.590 --> 33:04.460
The Ghost Spirit Sect practices a unique art.

33:05.030 --> 33:06.050
It's much more effective than the Blood Spirit Flower.

33:07.200 --> 33:09.330
Not only can it help your daughter to regain consciousness,

33:09.720 --> 33:10.730
but it can also

33:10.880 --> 33:12.050
cure her of her chronic ailment permanently.

33:14.550 --> 33:15.940
Young boy,

33:16.590 --> 33:17.940
no matter how flustered I am,

33:19.110 --> 33:20.570
I won't resort to such dubious methods.

33:24.030 --> 33:25.980
Young Lady's condition won't get any worse.

33:26.830 --> 33:28.420
Lord Yan, you should let me give it a go.

33:28.590 --> 33:29.530
If it doesn't work,

33:29.880 --> 33:31.220
you can use the Blood Spirit Flower

33:31.880 --> 33:32.730
to treat her by then.

33:35.110 --> 33:35.860
Speak.

33:36.510 --> 33:38.330
What conditions do you have?

33:41.830 --> 33:43.330
I want the Yan Clan Stronghold

33:44.960 --> 33:45.810
to be my ally.

33:52.550 --> 33:53.810
I finally returned alive

33:54.680 --> 33:55.950
from Bloody Trial Ground.

33:58.080 --> 33:58.980
Han.

34:05.830 --> 34:06.700
What are you doing here?

34:07.350 --> 34:08.660
I'm here to check on you.

34:09.350 --> 34:10.090
I heard

34:10.400 --> 34:12.380
that many people had died at Bloody Trial Ground.

34:15.160 --> 34:15.810
Indeed.

34:16.720 --> 34:19.140
Aren't we practicing cultivation to attain immortality?

34:20.270 --> 34:22.530
What's the point of us losing our lives

34:23.270 --> 34:24.570
just to obtain the Foundation Pill?

34:25.640 --> 34:28.220
There are many magnificent sights in the world.

34:30.510 --> 34:32.140
Go and check them out

34:32.350 --> 34:34.010
on my behalf.

34:38.090 --> 34:39.320
I suppose this is the path of cultivation.

34:40.070 --> 34:40.980
On this path,

34:42.640 --> 34:44.140
one will witness all kinds of sights.

34:47.480 --> 34:48.450
When you put it that way,

34:48.720 --> 34:49.770
I think it makes sense.

34:52.200 --> 34:53.010
However,

34:53.480 --> 34:55.050
you actually came back in one piece.

34:55.790 --> 34:56.490
That's great.

35:00.240 --> 35:00.900
I was merely lucky.

35:06.550 --> 35:07.490
Physician Mo.

35:08.830 --> 35:09.490
I think I understand a little

35:10.270 --> 35:11.940
of what you said before.

35:16.660 --> 35:20.300
♪Time and time again, it never changes...♪

35:24.030 --> 35:25.840
He addressed us as Mentors before this.

35:26.000 --> 35:27.490
Now, he's Master's disciple.

35:27.640 --> 35:29.220
Now, he'll address us as seniors.

35:29.480 --> 35:30.570
Our ranks have been lowered.

35:30.750 --> 35:32.050
I would rather let him address me as Senior.

35:32.160 --> 35:33.700
Mentor sounds old.

35:34.960 --> 35:36.380
I think someone arrived before us.

35:37.110 --> 35:38.730
They're sitting quite intimately as well.

35:40.740 --> 35:44.100
♪I'm a speck of dust in the sky...♪

35:46.440 --> 35:47.690
Don't tell me you're jealous.

35:48.230 --> 35:48.740
That's right.

35:48.880 --> 35:49.530
I'm jealous.

35:50.190 --> 35:52.210
You're not related to Xuan'er by any means.

35:53.230 --> 35:54.610
Who said so?

35:54.740 --> 35:57.460
♪Unafraid of the winding journey♪

35:58.660 --> 36:01.420
♪We promised to enter the dream together♪

36:04.580 --> 36:08.660
♪I fight only for you for the rest of my life♪

36:10.880 --> 36:11.460
Han Li.

36:12.320 --> 36:12.940
I heard

36:13.110 --> 36:14.650
that Master has taken you as his disciple.

36:15.400 --> 36:16.300
If so, I guess

36:16.550 --> 36:18.460
we're seniors and juniors now.

36:20.550 --> 36:21.170
Han,

36:21.590 --> 36:22.940
let's get into a fight one day.

36:25.840 --> 36:26.650
Han,

36:27.070 --> 36:28.900
I heard that your trip to Blood Trial Ground was a harrowing one.

36:29.320 --> 36:30.460
You should rest and recuperate.

36:32.110 --> 36:33.260
Do your best to cultivate.

36:33.590 --> 36:34.780
Don't embarrass our master.

36:36.100 --> 36:37.820
♪Searching and searching♪

36:39.020 --> 36:42.980
♪For your whereabouts♪

36:44.100 --> 36:47.300
♪Fate can besiege me♪

36:47.780 --> 36:51.260
♪With a thousand obstacles♪

36:52.420 --> 36:55.140
♪Courage turn♪

36:55.780 --> 36:59.340
♪Into a thousand sails♪

37:00.300 --> 37:01.780
♪The fate is sealed when we lock eyes♪

37:02.180 --> 37:03.860
♪Never turning back on this wayward journey♪

37:04.620 --> 37:07.500
♪Looking back at shared memories♪

37:08.020 --> 37:09.540
♪The long night ends♪

37:10.500 --> 37:14.820
♪As I fly to the shore where you belong♪

37:28.590 --> 37:29.420
My name is Han Li!

37:30.880 --> 37:31.900
This is so annoying.

37:32.230 --> 37:34.380
If this keeps up, it'll take ages before I can form a new core.

37:48.150 --> 37:48.980
I'm Han Li.

37:49.800 --> 37:50.570
What's your name?

37:54.230 --> 37:55.490
May I know your name?

37:59.550 --> 38:00.460
I'm Han Li.

38:00.590 --> 38:01.340
"Li", as in erecting a tombstone.

38:03.110 --> 38:04.130
This is so annoying.

38:04.920 --> 38:06.210
Once I'm done with my retreat,

38:06.480 --> 38:07.650
the first thing I'll do is to kill you.

38:08.190 --> 38:09.420
I'll erect a tombstone for you after that.

38:36.230 --> 38:37.900
If having one Foundation Pill isn't secure enough,

38:39.280 --> 38:40.570
I'll create 10 of them.

38:41.280 --> 38:42.050
Maybe even 20 of them.

39:06.710 --> 39:08.380
I must reach Tier 13 as soon as possible

39:08.880 --> 39:10.340
while waiting for the spirit herbs to ripen.

39:38.320 --> 39:39.820
I haven't even landed yet.

39:40.440 --> 39:41.610
Why is there already a banquet?

39:42.110 --> 39:42.980
I suppose your aunt

39:43.190 --> 39:44.210
prepared

39:44.550 --> 39:45.780
the welcoming banquet for you.

39:46.510 --> 39:47.460
As if.

39:47.960 --> 39:49.490
She doesn't care about me that much.

39:50.480 --> 39:51.610
Indeed.

40:02.980 --> 40:04.440
[Hongfen, Ghost Spirit Sect, Skull, Ghost Spirit Sect]

40:04.440 --> 40:05.530
Chan, you're here.

40:06.000 --> 40:07.530
You really know how to show up at the right time.

40:08.030 --> 40:08.860
Great timing.

40:09.110 --> 40:10.260
The banquet just started.

40:10.710 --> 40:11.860
Who are we holding this celebration for?

40:12.030 --> 40:14.210
Of course it's for me and your uncle-in-law.

40:14.400 --> 40:16.610
We won our first battle in the Jiang Kingdom.

40:16.800 --> 40:18.050
Once we take down Jiang Kingdom,

40:18.230 --> 40:20.130
Cheqi Kingdom will be next.

40:20.400 --> 40:21.740
After that, the Yue Kingdom.

40:23.110 --> 40:23.740
Aunt Hongfen,

40:24.550 --> 40:25.690
the Yue Kingdom is mine.

40:27.760 --> 40:29.530
"The Yue Kingdom is mine."

40:34.230 --> 40:36.090
You just managed to kill some of

40:36.400 --> 40:38.460
the righteous sects' Qi Refining Stage sect members at Bloody Trial Ground.

40:38.960 --> 40:40.130
Look at how smug you are.

40:40.840 --> 40:42.490
You command 50,000 elite troops.

40:42.670 --> 40:44.210
You begged and scraped and nearly killed yourself

40:44.800 --> 40:46.130
just to win this one battle.

40:46.360 --> 40:47.420
And now, you're actually holding a celebration?

40:49.190 --> 40:50.820
When it comes to being thick-skinned,

40:51.920 --> 40:53.420
Aunt Hongfen, I'm indeed no match for you.

40:57.590 --> 40:58.010
Hongfen!

40:58.230 --> 40:58.980
Don't be angry.

40:59.000 --> 40:59.490
Your nephew

40:59.630 --> 41:00.570
doesn't harbor any ill intentions.

41:00.840 --> 41:02.130
Indeed.

41:04.360 --> 41:04.900
By the way,

41:05.960 --> 41:06.980
I heard

41:07.400 --> 41:08.820
that you've been visiting the Yan Clan Stronghold quite frequently.

41:10.670 --> 41:12.780
No wonder you're so bent on getting the Yue Kingdom.

41:14.070 --> 41:15.090
Don't tell me

41:15.320 --> 41:16.650
you fell for the clan leader's daughter.

41:17.190 --> 41:18.460
And that you want to marry into their clan

41:19.230 --> 41:20.690
and become a live-in son-in-law.

41:24.510 --> 41:26.010
How did she find out about what I did at the Yan Clan Stronghold?

41:26.550 --> 41:27.530
Young Master, please calm down.

41:27.960 --> 41:28.900
Your aunt has spies

41:29.030 --> 41:29.980
all across the Tiannan Continent.

41:30.400 --> 41:31.610
She would've found out eventually

41:31.840 --> 41:33.090
even if we kept the news from her.

41:33.480 --> 41:34.300
Indeed.

41:34.840 --> 41:35.530
Fine.

41:37.000 --> 41:37.610
I understand.

41:38.630 --> 41:39.950
But you see,

41:40.550 --> 41:41.620
I have a mouth too.

41:42.480 --> 41:43.740
Can you let me break the news personally in the future?

41:44.320 --> 41:46.300
Just remember to keep your mouth shut.

41:46.630 --> 41:47.130
Yes, Young Master.

41:47.440 --> 41:49.420
Indeed.

41:50.760 --> 41:52.570
And, can you two learn

41:53.150 --> 41:55.050
how to speak formally, even just a little?

41:55.590 --> 41:56.850
When I bring you two to the Yan Clan Stronghold,

41:56.880 --> 41:57.480
you speak with

41:57.480 --> 41:58.370
a weird dialect

41:58.370 --> 41:59.880
while yours is even weirder.

42:03.590 --> 42:04.570
You must be kidding me.

42:26.840 --> 42:27.570
The Violet Monkey Blossom

42:28.440 --> 42:29.300
is finally ripe.

42:37.550 --> 42:38.650
I have enough herbs for the formula.

42:38.960 --> 42:40.380
I have the formula for the Foundation Pill too.

42:42.000 --> 42:42.820
With these,

42:43.190 --> 42:45.260
I have enough to create over 10 Foundation Pills.

42:57.070 --> 42:57.780
I've finally reached

42:58.110 --> 42:59.130
Tier 13.

42:59.800 --> 43:00.900
Now, I just need to reach the Foundation Establishment Stage.

43:17.580 --> 43:22.900
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

43:24.140 --> 43:29.540
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

43:29.660 --> 43:32.860
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

43:33.100 --> 43:35.340
♪Old scenes rise again♪

43:35.740 --> 43:38.580
♪Too hard to forget♪

43:39.100 --> 43:43.060
♪Easier just to miss♪

43:43.900 --> 43:49.380
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

43:50.540 --> 43:55.820
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

43:56.420 --> 43:59.460
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

43:59.740 --> 44:01.860
♪Swept away by time♪

44:02.500 --> 44:05.140
♪Eyes once looked far♪

44:05.620 --> 44:09.580
♪Now lost in the shift♪

44:10.060 --> 44:12.900
♪Autumn winds stir♪

44:13.180 --> 44:15.100
♪Smoke curls once more♪

44:15.540 --> 44:17.980
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

44:18.300 --> 44:21.820
♪Returning to my eyes♪

44:22.380 --> 44:25.340
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

44:25.660 --> 44:28.580
♪Time lost its name♪

44:28.980 --> 44:31.820
♪Was it yesterday♪

44:32.220 --> 44:35.780
♪Or tomorrow?♪

44:36.140 --> 44:38.980
♪The world has changed♪

44:39.380 --> 44:41.220
♪Beyond recall♪

44:41.780 --> 44:43.500
♪Time will fade♪

44:43.900 --> 44:48.700
♪All the words ever spoken♪

44:49.380 --> 44:52.260
♪Only this longing remains♪

44:52.740 --> 44:58.020
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

44:59.140 --> 45:05.780
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

45:06.260 --> 45:15.980
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
